{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"Google.Antigravity","latestVersion":"2.31.1","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.1abe6f2e.png","priority":1,"sha256":"1abe6f2ec956c5263164557ce3797d612bbcc453399faf50b184069d5453b86a","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"Google LLC","copyrightUrl":"https://antigravity.google/terms","description":"Experience liftoff with the next-gen agent platform.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Docs","DocumentUrl":"https://antigravity.google/docs"}],"license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://antigravity.google/terms","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Google LLC","copyrightUrl":"https://antigravity.google/terms","description":"Experience liftoff with the next-gen agent platform.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Docs","DocumentUrl":"https://antigravity.google/docs"}],"license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://antigravity.google/terms","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Antigravity 2.0 serves as your AI agents' central command center, providing a unified platform to launch, monitor, and orchestrate their activities. Unlike its predecessor, the Agent Manager, Antigravity 2.0 is a standalone application that functions independently of an IDE.\nWithin this interface, you can orchestrate agents both synchronously and asynchronously to:\n- Execute system commands\n- Perform file read/write operations\n- Conduct web searches\n- Integrate with external tools via skills and MCP servers\n- Manage subagents\n- Interact with Chrome\n- Create artifacts / implementation plans\nWhether you are performing deep research or building new applications, Antigravity offers a streamlined interface for all types of knowledge work.","name":"Antigravity","packageUrl":"https://antigravity.google/","privacyUrl":"https://policies.google.com/privacy","publisher":"Google","publisherSupportUrl":"https://antigravity.google/support","publisherUrl":"https://www.google.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://antigravity.google/pricing","releaseNotesUrl":"https://antigravity.google/changelog","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","artificial-intelligence","artificialintellicence","code","coding","develop","development","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"体验次世代智能体平台，开启飞跃之旅","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://antigravity.google/docs"}],"license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Antigravity 2.0 是您 AI 智能体的中央指挥中心，提供了一个统一的平台来启动、监控和编排它们的活动。与前身 Agent Manager 不同，Antigravity 2.0 是一个独立于 IDE 运行的应用程序。\n通过该界面，您可以同步或异步地编排智能体，以实现以下功能：\n- 执行系统命令\n- 进行文件读写操作\n- 开展网页搜索\n- 通过技能（Skills）和 MCP 服务器集成外部工具\n- 管理子智能体（Subagents）\n- 与 Chrome 浏览器交互\n- 创建制品（Artifacts）/ 实施计划\n无论您是进行深入研究还是构建新应用，Antigravity 都能为各类知识型工作提供流线型的操作界面。","privacyUrl":"https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=zh-CN","tags":["人工智能","代码","大语言模型","开发","智能体","编程","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"Antigravity 2.0 serves as your AI agents' central command center, providing a unified platform to launch, monitor, and orchestrate their activities. Unlike its predecessor, the Agent Manager, Antigravity 2.0 is a standalone application that functions independently of an IDE.\nWithin this interface, you can orchestrate agents both synchronously and asynchronously to:\n- Execute system commands\n- Perform file read/write operations\n- Conduct web searches\n- Integrate with external tools via skills and MCP servers\n- Manage subagents\n- Interact with Chrome\n- Create artifacts / implementation plans\nWhether you are performing deep research or building new applications, Antigravity offers a streamlined interface for all types of knowledge work.","name":"Antigravity","packageUrl":"https://antigravity.google/","privacyUrl":"https://policies.google.com/privacy","publisher":"Google","publisherSupportUrl":"https://antigravity.google/support","publisherUrl":"https://www.google.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://antigravity.google/pricing","releaseNotesUrl":"https://antigravity.google/changelog